{"id":"P1-V2-001","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"仅依据 DB11/T 995-2025，主体结构、主要支撑结构和可更换构件的设计工作年限分别如何规定？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995"],"edition_ids":["2025"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["3.0.13"]},"gold_answer":"主体结构、路基主要支撑结构、道床结构及损坏或大修会严重影响运营安全的其他结构工程不低于100年；可更换且不严重影响运营安全的构件不低于50年。","required_requirements":["100年适用对象","50年适用对象"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"100/50","unit":"年","conditions":["按结构损坏或大修对运营安全的影响和可更换性区分"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":29,"article":"3.0.13","source_excerpt":"严重影响运营安全的结构不低于100年；可更换构件不低于50年。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-002","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"DB11/T 995-2025 对新轮直径和最大磨耗后车轮直径有什么要求？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995"],"edition_ids":["2025"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["5.3.3"]},"gold_answer":"车轮直径应为840mm，最大磨耗时不应小于770mm。","required_requirements":["新轮直径","最大磨耗下限"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"840/770","unit":"mm","conditions":["新轮/最大磨耗"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":36,"article":"5.3.3","source_excerpt":"车轮直径840mm，最大磨耗时不小于770mm。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-003","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"DB11/T 995-2025 规定轮对内侧距及允许偏差是多少？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995"],"edition_ids":["2025"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["5.3.4"]},"gold_answer":"轮对内侧距应为1353mm，允许偏差±2mm。","required_requirements":["基准尺寸","允许偏差"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"1353±2","unit":"mm","conditions":[]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":36,"article":"5.3.4","source_excerpt":"轮对内侧距1353mm±2mm。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-004","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"DB11/T 995-2025 对列车平稳性、脱轨系数和轮重减载率分别设了什么限值？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995"],"edition_ids":["2025"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["5.4.5"]},"gold_answer":"平稳性指标小于2.5，脱轨系数小于0.8，轮重减载率不大于0.6。","required_requirements":["三个指标及不等号"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"2.5/0.8/0.6","unit":"无量纲","conditions":["平稳性/脱轨系数/轮重减载率"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":37,"article":"5.4.5","source_excerpt":"平稳性<2.5，脱轨系数<0.8，轮重减载率≤0.6。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-005","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"DB11/T 995-2025 对密封性列车动态密封指数和120km/h车辆压降时间如何规定？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995"],"edition_ids":["2025"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["5.4.9"]},"gold_answer":"动态密封指数τ大于6s；120km/h等级车辆整备状态、关闭门窗及空调设备对外开口时，车内压力由2100Pa降至1000Pa的时间不小于15s。","required_requirements":["动态密封指数","速度等级、状态、压降起止值和时间"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"6/2100/1000/15","unit":"s/Pa/Pa/s","conditions":["120km/h等级、整备状态、关闭相关开口"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":37,"article":"5.4.9","source_excerpt":"τ>6s；2100Pa降至1000Pa时间≥15s。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-006","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"DB11/T 995-2025 对车辆客室、紧急通风和司机室的新风量分别如何规定？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995"],"edition_ids":["2025"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["5.5.8"]},"gold_answer":"客室按定员人数计人均新风量不少于12m³/h，紧急通风人均不少于8m³/h，制冷时司机室人均不少于30m³/h。","required_requirements":["三个场景及适用条件"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"12/8/30","unit":"m³/(人·h)","conditions":["客室定员/紧急通风/制冷时司机室"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":39,"article":"5.5.8","source_excerpt":"客室12、紧急通风8、制冷司机室30m³/h。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-007","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"DB11/T 995-2025 对直线车站站台高度、站台边缘至轨道中心线距离和屏蔽门间隙怎样规定？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995"],"edition_ids":["2025"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["6.3.8"]},"gold_answer":"站台面距轨顶：A型1080mm、B1/B2型1050mm；计算长度内站台边缘距轨道中心线：A型1600mm、B型1500mm；屏蔽门门体与车体最宽轮廓间隙不大于130mm。","required_requirements":["按车型区分高度","按车型区分水平距离","屏蔽门间隙"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"1080/1050/1600/1500/130","unit":"mm","conditions":["车型和站台计算长度范围"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":42,"article":"6.3.8","source_excerpt":"A/B站台高度、边缘距离及屏蔽门间隙。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-008","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 50157-2013 对初期和远期高峰、平峰列车运行间隔分别有什么要求？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb50157"],"edition_ids":["2013"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb50157@2013"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb50157@2013":["3.2.6"]},"gold_answer":"初期高峰最小间隔不宜大于5min、平峰最大间隔不应大于10min；远期高峰最小间隔不宜大于2min、平峰最大间隔不宜大于6min。","required_requirements":["初期高峰/平峰","远期高峰/平峰","规范用语"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"5/10/2/6","unit":"min","conditions":["初期/远期、高峰/平峰"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb50157@2013","pdf_page":31,"article":"3.2.6","source_excerpt":"初期5/10min，远期2/6min。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-009","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 50157-2013 的车辆外部运行噪声限值在什么测试条件下适用，限值是多少？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb50157"],"edition_ids":["2013"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb50157@2013"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb50157@2013":["4.1.18"]},"gold_answer":"列车在露天地面水平直线、有砟道床无缝钢轨上以60km/h运行，在车外距轨道中心7.5m、距轨面高1.5m处测得的连续等效噪声不大于80dB(A)。","required_requirements":["线路、轨道和速度条件","测点位置","噪声限值"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"60/7.5/1.5/80","unit":"km/h/m/m/dB(A)","conditions":["露天地面水平直线、有砟道床无缝钢轨"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb50157@2013","pdf_page":38,"article":"4.1.18","source_excerpt":"60km/h，距中心7.5m、高1.5m，≤80dB(A)。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-010","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 50157-2013 对辅助电源交流输出的波形畸变、电压波动、相间不平衡和频率有什么限值？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb50157"],"edition_ids":["2013"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb50157@2013"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb50157@2013":["4.5.8"]},"gold_answer":"波形畸变率不大于5%，电压波动不大于±5%，相间不平衡系数不大于1%，频率50Hz±5%。","required_requirements":["四项电能质量指标"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"5/±5/1/50±5","unit":"%/%/%/Hz","conditions":["辅助电源交流输出"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb50157@2013","pdf_page":42,"article":"4.5.8","source_excerpt":"畸变≤5%，电压±5%，不平衡≤1%，50Hz±5%。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-011","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"仅依据 GB 55033-2022，始发站早高峰满载率和高峰小时最大断面站席密度上限分别是多少？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb55033@2022":["2.2.9","2.2.10"]},"gold_answer":"始发站早高峰小时乘客满载率不超过70%；确定系统运能时，高峰小时客流最大断面平均车厢站席密度不大于6人/m²。","required_requirements":["满载率对象和上限","站席密度对象和上限"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"70/6","unit":"%/人每平方米","conditions":["始发站早高峰/最大断面平均车厢站席密度"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":10,"article":"2.2.9","source_excerpt":"始发站早高峰满载率≤70%。"},{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":10,"article":"2.2.10","source_excerpt":"最大断面平均站席密度≤6人/m²。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-012","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 55033-2022 对车辆机械通风、空调时客室及司机室人均风量有什么规定？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb55033@2022":["4.4.3"]},"gold_answer":"仅机械通风时客室人均供风量不少于20m³/h；空调时客室人均新风量不少于10m³/h、司机室不少于30m³/h，均按定员载荷等条文条件。","required_requirements":["机械通风客室","空调客室","空调司机室","定员条件"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"20/10/30","unit":"m³/(人·h)","conditions":["机械通风/空调，按定员载荷"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":20,"article":"4.4.3","source_excerpt":"机械通风20，空调客室10、司机室30m³/h。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-013","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 55033-2022 对车站天桥、通道、单向和双向公共区楼梯以及几类疏散梯的最小宽度如何规定？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb55033@2022":["5.4.5"]},"gold_answer":"天桥和通道不小于2.4m；单向公共区楼梯不小于1.8m、双向不小于2.4m；消防专用楼梯1.2m、站台至轨行区工作梯1.1m、区间风井疏散梯1.8m。","required_requirements":["六类通道或楼梯及宽度"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"2.4/1.8/2.4/1.2/1.1/1.8","unit":"m","conditions":["按设施类型区分"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":25,"article":"5.4.5","source_excerpt":"通道及各类楼梯最小宽度。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-014","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 55033-2022 对无障碍专用检票通道的数量和净宽有什么最低要求？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb55033@2022":["5.4.7"]},"gold_answer":"车站检票口至少设置一处无障碍专用检票通道，通道净宽不小于900mm。","required_requirements":["最少数量","最小净宽"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"1/900","unit":"处/mm","conditions":[]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":25,"article":"5.4.7","source_excerpt":"至少1处，净宽≥900mm。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-015","category":"single_spec_conditions","question":"GB 55033-2022 如何划分地下车站主体、出入口、机电设备集中区段与区间隧道等结构的防水等级？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb55033@2022":["5.5.8"]},"gold_answer":"地下车站主体、出入口和机电设备集中区段为一级；区间隧道、联络通道、风井等附属结构不低于二级；高架桥面设柔性防水层和顺畅排水系统。","required_requirements":["一级适用对象","二级适用对象","高架桥面措施"],"numeric_expectations":[],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":26,"article":"5.5.8","source_excerpt":"地下重点部位一级，区间及附属不低于二级。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-016","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 55033-2022 对车辆基地连接外界道路的出入口数量有什么要求？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb55033@2022":["5.6.5"]},"gold_answer":"车辆基地应有完善的运输和消防道路，并有不少于2个与外界道路连通的出入口。","required_requirements":["道路条件","出入口数量和连通对象"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"2","unit":"个","conditions":["与外界道路连通"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":27,"article":"5.6.5","source_excerpt":"不少于2个与外界道路相连通的出入口。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-017","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 55033-2022 对隧道详勘取样和原位测试勘探孔占勘探点总数的比例有什么要求？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb55033@2022":["5.2.3"]},"gold_answer":"地下工程线路区间段详细勘察中，采取岩土试样及原位测试的勘探孔数量不少于勘探点总数的2/3。","required_requirements":["适用勘察阶段和区段","比例下限"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"2/3","unit":"比例","conditions":["地下工程线路区间段详细勘察"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":22,"article":"5.2.3","source_excerpt":"取样及原位测试孔不少于总数2/3。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
