{"id":"P1-V2-023","category":"cross_spec_numeric","question":"DB11/T 995-2025 与 GB 55033-2022 对A型车列车端部应急疏散门的净尺寸有什么共同要求？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995","cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2025","2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["5.6.3"],"cn.gb55033@2022":["4.2.1"]},"gold_answer":"两者均要求端部应急疏散专用门及下车设施，门宽不小于600mm、高不小于1800mm；GB 55033条文带有隧道或高架线且道中心设置逃生救援通道的适用条件。","required_requirements":["共同净尺寸","设施要求","GB 55033适用条件"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"600/1800","unit":"mm","conditions":["端部应急疏散门"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":39,"article":"5.6.3","source_excerpt":"端门宽≥600mm、高≥1800mm。"},{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":18,"article":"4.2.1","source_excerpt":"特定逃生通道系统A型车端门宽≥600mm、高≥1800mm。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
